<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2859_11239.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Frome, Edle, Erenueste, Fuersichtige, Ersame und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyse</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">densel</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtliche</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßtes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleiß</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>und vermoegens yederzeith zuuor, guenstige innsonders liebe herren
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weltkhundig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Teutschland</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="6"/>wegen der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solang</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewerthen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innhaimischen</unclear> und außlaendischen krieg,
<lb n="7"/>durch die beharrliche durchzueg, einquartierungen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steto</unclear>-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Contributiones</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwueßt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verderbt</unclear> und er-
<lb n="9"/>schoepfft worden, daß gleich kain stand noch statt der anderen
<lb n="10"/>mehr helffen noch rathen kan, sonder yeder selbsten mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hat</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> unß dann solche trangsalen fuer all andere stätt im
<lb n="13"/>haertesten ergriffen, und die sachen mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weith</unclear> durch
<lb n="14"/>die kayß.en Comissarios gebracht worden, wann wir nit inn
<lb n="15"/>kuertzer zeith dreyßig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tausend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gulden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kayß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cassa</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liffern</unclear>, und monatlich 1560. fl inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselbig</unclear> erstatten, daß der
<lb n="17"/><persName resp="#ner">herr von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oßa</unclear></persName> zue der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ligenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">starckhen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Soldatesca</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">13</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Comp.e</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solang</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueinquartieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hett</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uelch</unclear> und betrouth, biß wir angeregte 30.M fl völlig bezalen,
<lb n="20"/>dardurch wir, weil uns solches zuethuen unmöglich ist, inn die
<lb n="21"/>hoechste und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eusserste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerathen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> wir umb die Re-
<lb n="22"/>ligion und alle freyhaiten, ia gar vom <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-559" cert="medium" resp="#ner">heyl. Reich</orgName> komen moech-
<lb n="23"/>ten, wofer unß nit von anderen stätten und guethertzigen
<lb n="24"/>christen hilf geschicht, wann dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ft</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> und burgerschafft von Gott dem Allmaechtigen fuer
<lb n="26"/>andere reichlich gesegnet, unsere vorfaren, und wir zue den-
<lb n="27"/>selben auch yederzeith ein sonders gueth vertrauen gehabt,
